      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Because a bug has just become apparent in the gameification mechanics, please eliminate &#39;milestone partner rewards&#39;. Instead, use 8 x $900 prizes for weighted ticket holders in each small block and 9 x $24k prizes for the highest-ranked affiliates in each big block.\n\nEvery additional &#39;ticket&#39; improves the odds of winning.",
